sity, taking turns telling their team-mate it would have been better to try to take advantage. Colwill was too nice in that moment. Even as Chelsea were preparing to take the free-kick from which they scored their second, Joao Pedro was there, winding up Jordan Pickford while Everton’s goalkeeper was trying to organise his wall. As they told Colwill, they were not here to make friends, but to win. 📌 Kieran Gill + Daily Mail","image":"https://cdn4.telesco.pe/file/IazlNALSqdPokG2KqrTcDffGsHQXkPmA4M72PBDp2RMi129QQpzAIyvuqnTZwYFehefrmFOyMhgmxqKPnHdqE8kIbtWnGDUj6vQ2e86Wts8ookyDc1hwTbx5Yl7vtp4qjsqQYncg_zE8rZSIPs_Nwi0Q2nXXWKuCsLw9bxrEh2SlZ6uNIvW8zvfbK1iZoayD6_x7-Vks9oIiACo-aV7PMKi6w8-Wta2tyvQal5btfiMlLU5rNAneb21G4gIVFAYfiTUuA_yTuY6mJGs9EFQScU8OAuvymrJj1DRxudEcdcyTZlMZ7tMVCus74eh35dIXc-AOSClW68kRzllCY8e1SQ.jpg","video":"","hasVideo":false},{"id":"28644","date":"2026-10-18T21:55:40+00:00","text":"🏴󠁧󠁢󠁥󠁮󠁧󠁿 🗣 Jordan Henderson on doubt due to his age : \"Obviously, everyone around football talks whether that is the media or whatever. And, yeah, maybe that was the thought process, but I never felt that from Chelsea.\" \"From the minute that I spoke to them, and the manager, and the club, I still felt like they wanted me to help on the field. So that's all I try and do, and that's all the focus is on really, to be honest.\"","image":"https://cdn1.telesco.pe/file/OgFkO91IHt8o_tLH0bLGn7QZMK9w5YZ9d74BsKSv5cstuZZt3AwVq5i7adTAt4CE8VQ3r8m1hY3nLfJuIrs1IwS8G4In7AB4ZxbQXEYHGaRwSQJDRl7laaONfGbuEy-qaTP1y67GYPISjof-6t8oRKiBgHWngrvUnBx8ZRPvhEgcqofGMIVCZQNu1gWbTsZ7mcXEWNYUONHk7ens5ye2DN4VMR-H6MOJNiASAS7cdw0_JcGJVLWbKUg0QDjp89nu1HUd5nilGmupSYlKQYQdbuwtsphld921V1fr9xzoy62fc3hTOIOUVCu6TotBaX9pRefgnnfVQqP_xZuLADrabA.jpg","video":"","hasVideo":false},{"id":"28643","date":"2026-10-18T17:45:12+00:00","text":"🇵🇹 Win, Goals, Clean Sheet. Right in front of the Toffees badge too. Three Point Collectors 😁","image":"https://cdn4.telesco.pe/file/hs-a9jU8lWve15OaMwnHanYprooq0Tnk3WtKR8FtjKJTIVToxWhI0j0nVkH0BQV